# THE ONE SOURCE OF TRUTH for the live campaign (2026-08-18 night, PI:
# one stable spot v6e-8 pod finishes the rung — no multi-pod, no queued
# resources, no on-demand). Every launcher / supervisor / manual relaunch
# sources THIS file; nothing else carries these values.
#
# RUNG 1b (ledger 2026-08-19 RUNG-1b LAUNCH REGISTRATION): the cells owed by
# the rung-1 verdict — H-38 beta-rescale (A6/A7), H-39 A5 seeds, rt on every
# seed (+ rt-only for rung-1/rung-0 ckpts supplied in GCS), A8 d48@53k.
# (Rung 1 — d64/T6@53,333 A4x3/A3x2/A5x1, tag r1 — is COMPLETE and ledgered.)
#
# ARM ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING: chain_r0 keys its battery-partial GCS object to
# the FIRST arm (partial_A6s0.tgz for this campaign). Change the first arm and
# banked probe rows stop being restored on resume. Keep A6s0 first.
POD=qhrrn2-pod2
ZONES="us-east1-d us-east5-b us-central1-a us-west1-c"   # spot v6e-8 doors, US-only (PI); first = home
ACCEL=v6e-8
R_TAG=r1b
R_D=64
R_STEPS=53333
ARMS="A6s0 A7s0 A5s1 A6s1 A7s1 A5s2 A8s0 A4s1 A4s2 A3s1 A9s1 A9s2"
CHAIN_SCRIPT=tools/chain_r0.sh   # takes VH RG RB RT (tools/r0_tasks.sh); reads R_TAG/R_D/R_STEPS/R0_ARMS
# extra env for the chain (battery knobs, 2026-08-19): rt on every arm; rt-ONLY for
# the arms whose complete ckpts are supplied in GCS (rung-1 A4s1/A4s2/A3s1 and the
# rung-0 d48 A4s1/A4s2 under the A9 alias) — they SKIP pretrain and get only rt.
CHAIN_EXTRA_ENV="R0_RT_ALL=1 R0_RT_ONLY='A4s1 A4s2 A3s1 A9s1 A9s2'"
WALL=30600            # remote `timeout` ceiling per launch (s) — 8.5h
SENTINEL=CHAIN-R0-COMPLETE
GCS=gs://qhrrn2-rescue/rr1b
FINAL_OBJ=r0_final.tgz
CANARY_CKPT=runs/pretrain6_d24/ckpt_latest.pkl
